.TH MESH-COLORS 1 "2026-04-01" "v1.0" "Sovereign Mesh Manual"
.SH NAME
mesh-colors \- ANSI escape mappings for Forensic/Infrastructure states
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B Error (1+)
- RED TEXT / YELLOW BG (Operational)
.B Success (0)
- Green/Standard (Operational)
.SH DESCRIPTION
If a command fails with Exit 1, the terminal MUST render the path and error code in high-contrast red-on-yellow.
.SH SEE ALSO
gman(1), mesh-logs(1)
